  "subject": "A nine-year-old who already knows how to tie laces but keeps loosening them so the sixth-grade crossing guard with the yellow flag will kneel and re-tie them each morning, until she says she knew all along and just wanted a rest.",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien tropicália, playful late-1960s Brazilian psychedelic pop groove. Fuzz electric guitar with a short cheeky riff; berimbau twanging on the off beat; nylon guitar strumming steady open chords; electric bass bouncing; congas and a farfisa organ colouring the hook. Warm analog studio mix, slightly fuzzy guitar, dry vocal. Male tenor, light boyish and bright, clearly sung melody, one lead voice. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 112 BPM, A major. Cheeky, sunny schoolboy mischief. No rap, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no heavy distortion, no EDM drop.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n阿母講 鞋帶愛縛予好\n我早就會曉 我袂講\n校門口舉黃旗的姊姊\n逐早起 蹲落來共我縛\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我偷偷仔 共鞋帶放鬆\n姊姊的手 就來矣\n\n[Chorus]\n鬆矣鬆矣 鞋帶鬆去矣\n姊姊 請你 蹲落來\n蝴蝶結縛兩迴\n我今仔日 閣袂曉\n\n[Verse]\n同學笑我 九歲猶袂曉\n我講 這馬流行 鬆鬆仔\n鞋帶拖地 拖過水溝蓋\n黃旗仔搖搖 姊姊嘛笑\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n有一早 姊姊無蹲落\n伊共旗仔 插佇腰後\n\n[Chorus]\n鬆矣鬆矣 鞋帶鬆去矣\n姊姊 請你 蹲落來\n蝴蝶結縛三迴\n我明仔載 閣袂曉\n\n[Verse]\n伊講 你早就會曉縛\n我有看你 家己縛過\n我面紅甲 耳仔燒\n伊講 我嘛愛蹲咧歇\n\n[Bridge]\n這擺換我 蹲落來\n共姊姊的鞋帶 縛一个結\n\n[Chorus]\n鬆矣鬆矣 鞋帶鬆去矣\n姊姊 換我 蹲落來\n蝴蝶結縛四迴\n阮兩个 攏袂曉\n\n[Chorus]\n鬆矣鬆矣 鞋帶鬆去矣\n姊姊 換我 蹲落來\n蝴蝶結縛四迴\n阮兩个 攏袂曉\n\n[Outro]\n鞋帶鬆去矣\n鬆去矣 鬆去矣",
